  CellName: Longshot
  Description: 'Range - intensity 1 of Longshot: eight straight lances close to the core - room to
    learn to line up. The standard 1200 u cell with its nucleus (~392 u), no environment, no
    flora and no fauna. The field (8 lances of 48 cubes in 8 runs, 384 prisms in all, 720 u
    out) is laid by LongshotController. 4 omni crystals respawn inside the nucleus (the
    scene''s CrystalManager). Frenzy sits 25% above the full arena (11,184 prisms, 860,544
    volume). Authored by Tools/Build/author_longshot_assets.py - re-run it rather than
    hand-editing.'
